1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:01,950
The easy pass here is a trap.

2
00:00:02,060 --> 00:00:04,150
He beats his man and the help is coming.

3
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:04,830
Freeze.

4
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:06,430
A, B, or C?

5
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:08,010
Two seconds. Make your call.

6
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:11,430
A looks easy.

7
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:13,150
But his man is still home.

8
00:00:13,240 --> 00:00:15,510
B? His defender is sitting in the lane.

9
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:17,000
Now watch the low defender.

10
00:00:17,020 --> 00:00:19,050
He left the corner to stop the drive.

11
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:20,530
There! That's your window.

12
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:21,090
C!

13
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:21,660
Kick it.

14
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:23,790
The next rotation is a step too late.

15
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:25,840
The ball tells you where the play is.

16
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:27,990
The defense tells you where to pass.

17
00:00:28,020 --> 00:00:29,610
Did you see it before the reveal?

18
00:00:29,680 --> 00:00:30,470
Run it back.

